{"title":"Candy Cane","slug":"Candy_Cane","hero":{"file":"CandyCane.webp","width":196,"height":302},"pageid":1960,"revid":17084,"timestamp":"2025-02-05T18:22:29Z","lastEditor":"Quixoria","categories":["Items","Event_Items","Events"],"infobox":{"type":"Axe","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay and Ferwater"},{"label":"Shop","value":"The Oak Depot"},{"label":"Price","value":"$700"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.45.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"12/10/23"},{"label":"title1","value":"Candy Cane"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"gallery","text":"Gallery"}],"body":"<p><i><big>\"Mmmmm! Santa's favorite treat.\"</big></i>\n</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The <b>Candy Cane</b> is a temporarily purchasable item introduced in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Update_Log%2FVersion_1.45.0/\">v1.45.0</a>. Its appearance is that of a regular candy cane, with a red bow tie on it. It is purchased at the <b><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Oak_Depot/\">Oak Depot</a></b>, and can also be found in <b>Gift Landings</b> (unofficial name), the <b>Christmas Update</b>'s version of <b><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Meteor_Core/\">Meteor Crashes</a></b>. A green <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Spearmint_Candy_Cane/\">spearmint</a> version of it can also be obtained.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"gallery\">Gallery</h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"9ad8a83f8dc258d289f3674813a1f70e\" data-seq-no=\"1\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"Limited_in_Oak_Depot-png\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/Limited_in_Oak_Depot.png/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Candy Cane in Oak Depot\">Candy Cane in Oak Depot</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Candy Cane in Oak Depot\">Candy Cane in Oak Depot</span></a></div></div><div>Candy Cane in Oak Depot</div></div></div>"}
